[=#oracleserverversion]
= Server Version =

The //serverversion// option sets which Oracle version the Oracle protocol module imitates: 11.2 or 12.1.  It defaults to 12.1, and any other value is the same as leaving it out.  It also sets the default [oracleprotoverifiertype.html Password Verifier Type].  Some clients only support some protocol versions.  To support clients that need different versions, add a listener tag for each //serverversion//.

{{{#!blockquote
{{{#!code
@parts/sqlrelay-oraclefeserverversion.conf@
}}}
}}}

